{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Astro Amigo</strong> is a '90s sci-fi choose-your-adventure where a bullied kid stumbles into a cosmic mystery after his beloved dog, Amigo, goes missing. With summer break just days away, can he save his best friend before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/Astro_Amigo_Action.gif?t=1749483718\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOSTALGIC STORY SHAPED BY YOUR CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blow the dust off a lost '90s cartridge and dive into a story full of mystery, heart, and throwback thrills. Your choices shape the story\u2014twisting fates, discovering secrets, and unlocking one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PACKED WITH RETRO MINI-GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t just a story\u2014it\u2019s a blast of \u201890s gameplay nostalgia. Quirky mini-games full of charm: bike chases, dodgeball battles, late-night alien spotting,  fetch with your four-legged best friend, Amigo, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn pixel art paired with an analog synth composed original  soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feels like it was unearthed from a 1992 time capsule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, supernatural story shaped by the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy action-adventure gameplay full of nostalgic charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Packed with quirky retro mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovingly crafted by a passionate two-person team.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coming this summer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577850?t=1749483718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/e2c7168035065a655ed6fc0d93601e9e98ded10d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749483718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/043e7426656593ad7a611636475824a591bc2935/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749483718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/043e7426656593ad7a611636475824a591bc2935/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749483718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Astro Amigo</strong> is a '90s sci-fi choose-your-adventure where a bullied kid stumbles into a cosmic mystery after his beloved dog, Amigo, goes missing. With summer break just days away, can he save his best friend before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/Astro_Amigo_Action.gif?t=1749483718\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOSTALGIC STORY SHAPED BY YOUR CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blow the dust off a lost '90s cartridge and dive into a story full of mystery, heart, and throwback thrills. Your choices shape the story\u2014twisting fates, discovering secrets, and unlocking one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PACKED WITH RETRO MINI-GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t just a story\u2014it\u2019s a blast of \u201890s gameplay nostalgia. Quirky m